    "lifecycleScope": "session"
  },
  "limitations": [
    "Discovery is bounded to configured paths, the MODKIT_STARCRAFT1_ROOT environment root, the registry values the installers write (the Remastered uninstall entry and the Blizzard Entertainment\\Starcraft InstallPath) read through the host's installation probes, and platform defaults; it never scans a drive.",
    "Remastered is confirmed by the active record in .build.info naming the StarCraft CASC product (s1, or the sc1 CDN path when the product column is empty). A classic 1.x installation is confirmed by StarDat.mpq beside StarCraft.exe or storm.dll, and is named Brood War when BrooDat.mpq is present.",
    "No version is reported for a classic installation: it has no build record, and reading the version resource of its executable is not implemented.",
    "Launching, provisioning and content mounting are outside this provider."
  ]
